    "description": "Class III, mains-operated, self-indicating, price-computing, single or dual-interval, non-automatic weighing instrument designed for direct sales to the public. Plastic construction with operator's keypad, stainless steel load receptor, operator LCD display, pole-mounted customer LCD display, level indicator and integrated printer. Devices: initial zero setting device, semi-automatic zero setting device, zero tracking device (around gross or net zero), zero indicator, net indicator, stable weight indicator, semi-automatic subtractive tare weighing device, gravity compensation, price-computing, totalisation (including non-weighed items), PLU, fixed weight labelling, multi-vendor operation, calibration/set-up mode via sealed internal switch. Interfaces (some optional): RS232C, cash drawer, USB Device, USB Host, RS485, ZigBee, wired LAN, wireless LAN. Calibration and setup parameters can only be accessed via the sealed switch located on the main board. Alternative: the instrument may be fitted with a Preset Tare device, in which case the semi-automatic tare device is a balancing tare device."
